{"id":"z07-Tarragon-3","key":"Tarragon","originalRawSha256":"e56b94a70c1de1dae7751d096dd7382c6f3cacaad649db8e875844f8c064b3b7","old":"\"spn\">Artemisa","new":"\"spn\">Artemisia","decision":"retained","acceptancePath":"independent-agreement","reason":"Native species citation is A. dracunculus, with immediately preceding explicit genus Artemisia. GCIDE/frozen source already expands that genus to Artemisa dracunculus. Exact new corrects the missing i in that existing expansion, preserving the electronic full-name convention and species epithet; it does not claim the full spelling is literally printed at the abbreviated A. position. This edit is supported jointly with the explicit native genus and the matching electronic taxon identity.","witness":{"url":"https://archive.org/download/webstersinternat02websuoft/page/n522.jpg?scale=1","edition":"1895 printing","pageId":"v2-n522.jpg","pageSha256":"4d4d0d3ad322b3dc1724f9fc3425b45e9dabf8b40a0c8071ea9703f4a34dd863","nativeBox":[787,220,1150,250],"nativeCropSha256":"b6ac20c456608291134e079a36716077e747df4e8cb6a3eff6b2cac0d441f096"},"readers":[{"reviewer":"root-native-reader","certain":true,"fragmentSha256":"94390768fd1595dd52584f5c57f95b79c4908fa55ad59d9ae24666ce0f2705aa"},{"reviewer":"fresh-native-reader","certain":true,"fragmentSha256":"94390768fd1595dd52584f5c57f95b79c4908fa55ad59d9ae24666ce0f2705aa"}],"completeEntryReviewCredit":false}
